    <string name="about_diceware_title">What is Diceware?</string>
    <string name="about_diceware_body">Diceware makes a passphrase from words chosen by rolls of dice. Each roll of five dice (four for a short word list), such as 4 3 5 6 1, picks one word from the word list. Repeating this once per word gives a passphrase that is easy to remember and hard to guess. This app rolls each die with your device\'s secure random generator.</string>
    <string name="about_word_lists_title">Word lists</string>
    <string name="about_word_lists_body">The built-in word lists are the EFF Word Lists by the Electronic Frontier Foundation (eff.org/dice), used under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 License (CC BY 3.0, creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0).</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Diceware keeps no history of your passphrases, writes no logs and has no analytics. The only time it uses the network is when you ask it to check eff.org for updated EFF Word Lists.</string>
